'''Belts''' are a [[item class|class of items]] that can provide certain bonuses when [[Equipment|equipped]]. They are categorised as [[jewellery]].

Most of the explicit modifiers which can be rolled on belts provide strictly defensive bonuses such as increases to [[resistances]] or [[defences]]. They can also roll modifiers that modify [[flask]]s.

